{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive\/expose()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"expose"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Public because §20 hands the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"requesting party’s"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" token to the calling application: an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"RPT exists to be sent onward on the retried request, and a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UmaRequestingPartyToken"},{"text":" whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessToken"},{"text":" could never be read would make the whole ticket grant unusable. The same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applies to a PAT an application obtained elsewhere and now has to hand to the Protection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API. Widening from module-internal is additive and breaks no existing caller.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this only at the point of actually using the value","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — attaching it to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":" header, writing it to your own encrypted store — and never pass the result"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a log, trace, or serialisation sink. "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive\/description","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive\/debugDescription","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"itself still always redact, but that protection does not follow the raw value once this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method returns it."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the protected value — this SDK’s single explicit accessor (§7 rule 3)."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/sensitive\/expose()"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"expose","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"expose()","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV6exposexyF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/Sensitive":{"title":"Sensitive","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sensitive"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/sensitive","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sensitive"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A wrapper for secret material (§7 of CONTRACT.md)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Axiam